{
  "appSlug": "myfitnesspal",
  "version": 1,
  "status": "verified",
  "executor": "cloud",
  "baseUrl": "https://api.myfitnesspal.com/v2",
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "sessionKeys": [
      "headers.authorization",
      "headers.mfp-user-id"
    ],
    "refresh": {
      "method": "GET",
      "urlTemplate": "https://www.myfitnesspal.com/user/auth_token?refresh=true",
      "headers": {
        "accept": "application/json"
      }
    },
    "check": {
      "method": "GET",
      "urlTemplate": "https://api.myfitnesspal.com/v2/nutrient-goals?date={{today}}",
      "headers": {
        "authorization": "{{session.headers.authorization}}",
        "mfp-client-id": "mfp-main-js",
        "mfp-user-id": "{{session.headers.mfp-user-id}}",
        "accept": "application/json"
      }
    }
  },
  "tools": [
    {
      "name": "search_food",
      "title": "Search foods",
      "description": "Search the MyFitnessPal food database. Returns items[].item with id, version, description, brand_name, nutritional_contents (per base serving) and serving_sizes[] ({value, unit, nutrition_multiplier}). Pass id, version and one serving size to log_food.",
      "kind": "read",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "query": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Food name, e.g. \"banana\" or \"chobani greek yogurt\""
          },
          "limit": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 25,
            "default": 5
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "query"
        ]
      },
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "urlTemplate": "https://api.myfitnesspal.com/v2/nutrition?q={{query}}&max_items={{limit}}&fields%5B%5D=nutritional_contents&fields%5B%5D=serving_sizes",
        "headers": {
          "authorization": "{{session.headers.authorization}}",
          "mfp-client-id": "mfp-main-js",
          "mfp-user-id": "{{session.headers.mfp-user-id}}",
          "accept": "application/json"
        }
      },
      "extract": "items",
      "sample": {
        "args": {
          "query": "banana",
          "limit": 5
        },
        "ok": true,
        "at": 1794779051918
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "get_diary",
      "title": "Read food diary",
      "description": "Food entries logged on a date: each item has id (use it to delete), meal_name, food {id, description}, servings, serving_size and nutritional_contents (totals for that entry). Defaults to today.",
      "kind": "read",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "date": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "YYYY-MM-DD",
            "default": "{{today}}"
          }
        }
      },
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "urlTemplate": "https://api.myfitnesspal.com/v2/diary?entry_date={{date}}&types=food_entry&fields%5B%5D=nutritional_contents&fields%5B%5D=food&fields%5B%5D=serving_size&fields%5B%5D=meal_name&fields%5B%5D=servings",
        "headers": {
          "authorization": "{{session.headers.authorization}}",
          "mfp-client-id": "mfp-main-js",
          "mfp-user-id": "{{session.headers.mfp-user-id}}",
          "accept": "application/json"
        }
      },
      "extract": "items",
      "sample": {
        "args": {},
        "ok": true,
        "at": 1794779051918
      },
      "omit": [
        "food.serving_sizes",
        "food.nutritional_contents",
        "food.user_id",
        "food.version",
        "food.public",
        "food.type",
        "food.country_code",
        "food.deleted",
        "food.created_at",
        "serving_size.id",
        "serving_size.nutrition_multiplier",
        "serving_size.is_fraction",
        "type",
        "client_id",
        "meal_position",
        "meal_food_id",
        "created_at"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "log_food",
      "title": "Log food",
      "description": "Add a food to the diary. Get food_id, food_version and a serving size from search_food first. servings multiplies the chosen serving (2 bananas = serving_unit \"banana\", servings 2).",
      "kind": "write",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "food_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "items[].item.id from search_food"
          },
          "food_version": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "items[].item.version from search_food"
          },
          "meal": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "Breakfast",
              "Lunch",
              "Dinner",
              "Snacks"
            ],
            "default": "Snacks"
          },
          "servings": {
            "type": "number",
            "default": 1
          },
          "serving_value": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "serving_sizes[].value",
            "default": 1
          },
          "serving_unit": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "serving_sizes[].unit, e.g. \"banana\" or \"g\""
          },
          "serving_multiplier": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "serving_sizes[].nutrition_multiplier"
          },
          "date": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "YYYY-MM-DD",
            "default": "{{today}}"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "food_id",
          "food_version",
          "serving_unit",
          "serving_multiplier"
        ]
      },
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "urlTemplate": "https://api.myfitnesspal.com/v2/diary",
        "headers": {
          "authorization": "{{session.headers.authorization}}",
          "mfp-client-id": "mfp-main-js",
          "mfp-user-id": "{{session.headers.mfp-user-id}}",
          "accept": "application/json",
          "content-type": "application/json"
        },
        "bodyTemplate": "{\"items\":[{\"type\":\"food_entry\",\"date\":\"{{date}}\",\"meal_name\":\"{{meal}}\",\"servings\":{{servings}},\"food\":{\"id\":\"{{food_id}}\",\"version\":\"{{food_version}}\"},\"serving_size\":{\"value\":{{serving_value}},\"unit\":\"{{serving_unit}}\",\"nutrition_multiplier\":{{serving_multiplier}}}}]}"
      },
      "extract": "items.0",
      "sample": {
        "args": {
          "food_id": "90048150924533",
          "food_version": "233815641308285",
          "meal": "Snacks",
          "servings": 1,
          "serving_value": 1,
          "serving_unit": "banana",
          "serving_multiplier": 1.26
        },
        "ok": true,
        "at": 1794779051918
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "delete_food_entry",
      "title": "Remove diary entry",
      "description": "Delete one food entry from the diary by its id (get_diary items[].id or log_food result id).",
      "kind": "write",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "entry_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Diary entry id (uuid)"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "entry_id"
        ]
      },
      "request": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "urlTemplate": "https://api.myfitnesspal.com/v2/diary/{{entry_id}}",
        "headers": {
          "authorization": "{{session.headers.authorization}}",
          "mfp-client-id": "mfp-main-js",
          "mfp-user-id": "{{session.headers.mfp-user-id}}",
          "accept": "application/json"
        }
      },
      "extract": "",
      "sample": {
        "args": {
          "entry_id": "aae416c9-43d6-44db-a385-f3c89abbe4cd"
        },
        "ok": true,
        "at": 1794779051918
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "get_goals",
      "title": "Nutrition goals",
      "description": "Daily calorie and macro goals in effect on a date: default_goal and daily_goals[] (per weekday) with energy {value, unit}, carbohydrates, protein, fat (grams) and micronutrients.",
      "kind": "read",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "date": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "YYYY-MM-DD",
            "default": "{{today}}"
          }
        }
      },
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "urlTemplate": "https://api.myfitnesspal.com/v2/nutrient-goals?date={{date}}",
        "headers": {
          "authorization": "{{session.headers.authorization}}",
          "mfp-client-id": "mfp-main-js",
          "mfp-user-id": "{{session.headers.mfp-user-id}}",
          "accept": "application/json"
        }
      },
      "extract": "items.0",
      "sample": {
        "args": {},
        "ok": true,
        "at": 1794779051918
      }
    }
  ],
  "playbook": [
    "Open https://www.myfitnesspal.com/account/login in the in-app browser and sign in with email and password (Google and Facebook sign-in are blocked inside embedded browsers)",
    "Wait for /api/auth/session to return a user",
    "Call /user/auth_token?refresh=true from the signed-in page to mint the API bearer token (access_token, user_id)",
    "Visit /food/diary for today",
    "Visit /account/my-goals",
    "Run a food search (/api/nutrition?query=banana)"
  ],
  "provenance": {
    "compiler": "hand",
    "compiledAt": 1794779051918,
    "captureCount": 9,
    "notes": "Verified live 2026-11-15 on a real account with scripts/re/mfp/client.ts: auth.check, get_goals, search_food, get_diary pass on the cloud path (plain fetch, residential IP) and on the device path (in-page fetch from www.myfitnesspal.com, cookies omitted for the API host, CORS allows it); log_food (201) then get_diary showed the entry, delete_food_entry (204) then get_diary showed it gone. Confirmed live: /user/auth_token?refresh=true returns {token_type, access_token, expires_in: 864000, refresh_token, user_id} from the cookie session (HttpOnly NextAuth cookie, so it must run on the device); /api/auth/session returns {} when signed out. Confirmed in source: same token exchange and headers (Authorization Bearer, mfp-client-id mfp-main-js, mfp-user-id) in coddingtonbear/python-myfitnesspal client.py; POST /v2/diary body and DELETE /v2/diary/{id} in AdamWalt/myfitnesspal-mcp-python and zN3utr4l/MFP-Auto. The website itself never calls api.myfitnesspal.com from the browser: it proxies through www.myfitnesspal.com/api/services/* (cookie only), which the device path can also use. Assumed, not tested: api.myfitnesspal.com accepts calls from Convex datacenter IPs (www is Cloudflare-fronted and blocks datacenter traffic more often); each auth_token call rotates tokens."
  }
}
